import LOEIS.A330.A330365.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A330365

Lexicographically earliest sequence of distinct terms starting with a(1) = 1 ("one") such that the letter count of a(n) + the letter count of a(n+1) = the letter count of [a(n) + a(n+1)].

The 80 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A330365

/-- Known terms of `A330365`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [1, 10, 2, 20, 3, 30, 4, 9, 5, 40,
    6, 7, 50, 8, 60, 41, 72, 42, 71, 53,
    61, 51, 63, 54, 59, 55, 64, 49, 65, 57,
